#privacy_policy.html
title_policy = Privacy Policy — Zero Caloriy
description_policy = Information about the collection, use, and protection of personal data of Zero Caloriy users in Kyiv.
hi_privacy_policy = Privacy Policy

p_one_policy-html = This Privacy Policy applies to the website with the domain name <strong>zerocaloriy</strong> and its subdomains. It contains information about what data the website administrator or third parties may receive when a user (you) visits the website.

h3_private_info = Personal information collected during website visits
p_private_one = Personal information is voluntarily provided by the user when visiting the website, such as first name, last name, phone number, email address, delivery address for goods and services, company details represented by the user, job position, social media accounts, and other fields completed in forms.
p_private_two = This data is collected for the purpose of providing services, selling goods, communicating with the user, performing other user actions on the website, and sending information that the user has consented to receive.
p_private_three-html = <strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> We do not verify the accuracy of the provided data and cannot guarantee the quality of orders, services, or feedback if incorrect information is provided. Data is collected through input forms on the website (e.g., registration, ordering, subscription, reviews, questions, feedback, etc.). Forms on the website may transmit data directly to the website or to third-party websites (third-party service scripts).
p_private_four = Data may be collected directly by the website or by third-party service scripts using cookies. This data is collected automatically, and you can prevent its transmission by disabling cookies in the browser used to access the website.

h3_not_private_data = Non-personal data
p_not_private_one = In addition to personal data, non-personal data is also collected when visiting the website. This data is automatically collected by the web server hosting the website, CMS tools (content management system), and third-party scripts installed on the website.
p_not_private_two = Automatically collected data includes:
li_not_private_one = Your IP address and its country of registration; the domain name from which you accessed the website;
li_not_private_two = Visitor navigation from one website page to another;
li_not_private_three = Information voluntarily provided by your browser during website visits;
li_not_private_four = Cookies; recorded visits;
li_not_private_five = Other data collected by third-party analytics counters installed on the website.
p_not_private_three = This data does not personally identify you and is intended to improve customer service, enhance website usability, and analyze traffic statistics.

h3_transfer_data = Transfer of data to third parties
li_transfer_data_one-html = <strong>Publicly available user data:</strong> Your personal data may be publicly available according to the website functionality. For example, when leaving reviews or questions, the name provided by the user may be displayed. Such activity is voluntary, and the user gives consent to such disclosure through their actions.
li_transfer_data_two = Information may be disclosed when required by law, to prevent fraud or other illegal activities, or in other cases предусмотренных by the legislation of Ukraine.
li_transfer_data_three = For the purpose of providing services and fulfilling obligations, the user consents to the transfer of personal data to third parties in order to deliver services ordered on the website and to fulfill other obligations to the user. Such third parties include, but are not limited to, courier services, postal services, and transportation companies.

h3_third_party_services = Third-party services available on the website
p_third_party_services_one = The website may contain forms that collect personal data by other organizations. In such cases, the third-party organization will collect, store, and protect the user's personal information in accordance with its own privacy policy. The collection, storage, and protection of information received from third-party organizations are carried out in accordance with this Privacy Policy.

h3_data_protect = Data protection
p_data_protect_one = We take appropriate security measures to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, and destruction of data that we collect, store, and process, as well as to limit access to personal data by our employees, contractors, and agents and to prevent unauthorized access to our systems, including physical access. We continuously improve our methods of data collection, storage, and processing, including through the implementation of security measures.

h3_acceptance_policy = Acceptance of this Policy
p_acceptance_policy_one = By using this website, you acknowledge that you accept this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with this Policy, please do not use this website.
p_acceptance_policy_two = Your continued use of the Website after any changes to this Policy are made will be deemed your acceptance of such changes.

h3_disclaimer = Disclaimer
p_disclaimer_one = This Privacy Policy does not apply to any other websites, including third-party websites that may link to this website or websites that are linked from this website. We are not responsible for the content or practices of such websites.

h3_change_privacy = Changes to this Privacy Policy
p_change_privacy_one = We may update this Privacy Policy at any time at our sole discretion. We recommend that you review this page regularly to stay informed about any changes in how we protect the information we collect about you. By using the Website, you agree that you are responsible for regularly reviewing the Privacy Policy and any amendments thereto.

h3_public_offers = Public offers
p_public_offers_one = Please note that the Website is for informational purposes only, and in any case, informational materials and prices published on the Website do not constitute a public offer under applicable law.
